41	
42	IMPORTANT: Use \`terminal\` tool with \`curl\` for ALL Paperclip API calls (web_extract and browser cannot access localhost).
43	
44	Your Paperclip identity:
45	  Agent ID: {{agentId}}
46	  Company ID: {{companyId}}
47	  API Base: {{paperclipApiUrl}}
48	
49	{{#taskId}}
50	## Assigned Task
51	
52	Issue ID: {{taskId}}
53	Title: {{taskTitle}}
54	
55	{{taskBody}}
56	
